<title>UK: BAWAG sets 300 mln mark four-year bond.</title>
<headline>BAWAG sets 300 mln mark four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bayerische Landesbank GZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK FUR ARBEIT UND WIRTSCHAFT (VIENNA)</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.625     MATURITY    16.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.70    PAY DATE    16.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.15	REOFFER    99.775    SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    MUN/FFT   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC   1.525</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
